{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MistyPuzzle: A Zen Puzzle Odyssey</strong><br><i>A meditative puzzle experience with layered challenges</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in tranquil melodies and minimalist aesthetics - this sanctuary of relaxation challenges you to assemble shapes through strategic layer occlusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660630/extras/3\u670824\u65e5_1_.gif?t=1744618462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong><br>Deceptively simple, profoundly engaging:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drag and drop fragments from the palette</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate pieces to find perfect alignment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continuously rearrange layers to reveal hidden configurations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But be warned</strong> - these aren't ordinary puzzles. Our mind-bending structures will:<br>\ud83c\udf00 Challenge your spatial perception<br>\ud83c\udfaf Test your pattern recognition<br>\ud83d\udca1 Reward persistent problem-solvers<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660630/extras/3\u670824\u65e5_2_.gif?t=1744618462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Content Overview</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 meticulously crafted chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">120 evolving puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden Easter eggs in every chapter <i>(Share your discoveries with fellow players!)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660630/extras/3\u670824\u65e5_3_.gif?t=1744618462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Final Note from Developers</strong><br>May this brief yet delightful journey grant you:<br>\ud83e\uddd8 A mindful escape from daily stresses<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Creative fulfillment through focused problem-solving<br>\u23f3 Precious moments of digital serenity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Perfect for: Puzzle enthusiasts seeking mental stimulation &amp; relaxation seekers needing cognitive decompression</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2660630?t=1744618462","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2660630?t=1744618462","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660630/d780e78a2b8a2371bbec6321d53ce1b51aedb341/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744618462","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660630/d780e78a2b8a2371bbec6321d53ce1b51aedb341/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744618462","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MistyPuzzle: A Zen Puzzle Odyssey</strong><br><i>A meditative puzzle experience with layered challenges</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in tranquil melodies and minimalist aesthetics - this sanctuary of relaxation challenges you to assemble shapes through strategic layer occlusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660630/extras/3\u670824\u65e5_1_.gif?t=1744618462\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong><br>Deceptively simple, profoundly engaging:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drag and drop fragments from the palette</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate pieces to find perfect alignment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continuously rearrange layers to reveal hidd